    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">Hum %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_what">Hum or sing a tune and it is written down as notes, to fix and send to a DAW as MIDI or as sheet music.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_heading">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">Everything you record stays on this phone. The app has no internet access, so nothing is sent anywhere, and nothing is collected about you. The microphone is used only while you are recording. A take leaves the phone only when you send it or save it to a file yourself. There are no ads, no analytics and no tracking.</string>
